        <div class="bio-container">
            <h3 data-es="ABOUT ME – DIEGO" data-en="ABOUT ME – DIEGO">ABOUT ME – DIEGO</h3>
            <p class="bio-tagline" data-es="Tu amigo local y Concierge Privado en Cartagena" data-en="Your Local Friend & Private Concierge in Cartagena">Your Local Friend & Private Concierge in Cartagena</p>
            <p class="bio-text" data-es="¡Hola! Soy Diego. Llevo 24 años viviendo en Cartagena y cuento con más de dos años de experiencia ofreciendo atención VIP personalizada. Mi compromiso es brindarte transparencia, honestidad y cuidar cada detalle para que disfrutes de las mejores playas, yates y gastronomía con tranquilidad absoluta. ¡Hagamos memorables tus vacaciones!" data-en="Hi! My name is Diego. Cartagena has been my home for 24 years, and with over two years of concierge experience, my mission is to share the true beauty of my city. Built on honesty and transparent advice, I take care of every detail—from private boats to top gastronomy—so you can enjoy an unforgettable trip. Let's make great memories together!">Hi! My name is Diego. Cartagena has been my home for 24 years, and with over two years of concierge experience, my mission is to share the true beauty of my city. Built on honesty and transparent advice, I take care of every detail—from private boats to top gastronomy—so you can enjoy an unforgettable trip. Let's make great memories together!</p>
        </div>
    </section>

